Third-party components
----------------------

Listed as they are added. Each keeps the licence it arrived with, stated in the
directory that contains it.

- (pending) mflowgen node library used by the ASIC flow — Apache License 2.0.
  Vendored deliberately: without it the flow's construct scripts describe a
  graph whose steps live at an unpinned commit in a repository outside this
  project, so published area figures would become unreproducible if it moved,
  and the failure would be silent.

Deliberately NOT vendored
-------------------------

- The process design kit used by the ASIC flow. Its redistribution terms have
  not been reviewed. The flow fetches it and verifies the standard-cell library
  by checksum, which gives reproducibility without redistribution. Do not
  commit it without checking those terms first.

External results referenced
---------------------------

Published figures from third-party work (for example a comparison design's own
reported area) are cited with their source, node, configuration and scope, and
are used only as order-of-magnitude checks. They are not republished as ours.
